From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:14:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 178/207] Route exact rational expressions through existing
 graph templates

Bind finite decimal arithmetic and explicit fraction(expr) inline requests with checked computed exponents and wide output. Refuse nonterminating default results and keep Python binary64 sources outside this route. The v7 graph bank is unchanged.

813 reference cases pass in three evaluator modes, with 64 Dispatch proofs, stale-answer and refusal controls, and 6356 legacy routables plus 20 routed samples. Formatting, lean identity comparison and 22 project gates pass. Plain build remains pending after the base-reproducible 2 GiB compiler resource failure.

(cherry picked from commit 4794f2249c8c4b24e242397e20da7af5bf7d4ef6)
